# Comments are ENGLISH here as everywhere else in the repository; only the msgstr are
# French. What is in French below is the translation, never the note about it.
#
# Settled renderings: spirimonster -> spirimonstre, spiricosm -> spiricosme, Gloom -> Terne,
# Fiery -> Ardent, Wonderful -> Merveilleux. A spirimonster SPECIES is a "variété" in
# French, never an "espèce" — a point of lore, not of vocabulary.
# "round" and "turn" are BOTH "tour": French draws no distinction there, and "ronde" is
# wrong for either.
# Species names (kalilk, érzélak…) are common nouns and are NOT translated.

